ont-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"633.0\" dy=\"0\">Gates / Softmax</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"795.0\" y=\"721\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#dfdff8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"818.0\" y=\"734\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"818.0\" dy=\"0\">Linear / outputs</tspan>\n</text>\n<rect xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"980.0\" y=\"721\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#cdeaf8\" stroke=\"#263348\" />\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"1003.0\" y=\"734\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#172336\">\n<tspan x=\"1003.0\" dy=\"0\">Tensor operations</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"762\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">B=batch; supplied H:[B,8,16]; r3 hops; attention:[B,3,8].</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Source lacks padding masking; each hop normalizes over sequence positions.</tspan>\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"16.52\">Classifier and embedding/LSTM producer are outside the selected boundary.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"866\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Reviewed static source + selected profile. Repeated groups are templates; shapes are not runtime observations.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"896\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">E### = source span; dashed = side / shape dependencies; fork/join roles are typed in IR; no implicit sum.</tspan>\n</text>\n<text xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"921\" font-family=\"DejaVu Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#344155\">\n<tspan x=\"600.0\" dy=\"0\">Repeated colors encode operation roles. Shared weights and independent instances are recorded in semantic_ir.json.</tspan>\n</text>\n",
